  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the jurisdictional and communicational capacities of the IACtHR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The projects final goal is to contribute to the protection and guarantee of Human Rights in the Americas 
The expected outcomes of the project is the following: State compliance with the Judgements of the Inter-American Court has improved; Stakeholders&#x2019; interaction with the Inter-American Court is enhanced; Victims demonstrating financial need have increased access to litigation; The IACtHR improves its capacity to efficiently process cases.</narrative>
  </description>
